: **Command E1()** : Initial execution command. Inside the command, there are various functions and code instructions, all related to the program's startup and possible automatic adaptations and restarts.

[[collapsible hideLocation="both" show="+ CLICK HERE TO SEE MORE" hide="- CLOSE"]]



[[code type="Java"]]

// D1 starter point. Check later (Nick touched something)

package scp9747.bootstrap;



import java.time.Instant;

