= [[span class="titled"]]ADDENDUM 9923.II:[[/span]] Intrusion Attempts



----



**ATTEMPT, THE FIRST:** [[[/task-forces#kappa-10 | MTF Kappa-10 ("Skynet")]]] is reconfigured to process nonlogical systems by [[[scp-5145 | salvador.aic]]], Surrealistics' primary AIC.[[span class="fnnum"]].[[/span]][[span class="fncon"]][[span class="titled"]]SALVADOR.AIC:[[/span]] Artificially-Intelligent Conscript designed to handle alternative frames of logical reference. Enjoys trips to the theater.[[/span]] Upon uploading to Nx-9923, its abstruse conceptual environment causes the gradual distortion of MTF Kappa-10’s personality drivers, rendering coherent communication and fulfillment of directives impossible. Remains of personality drivers later recovered by the Department of Surrealistics and refashioned into raincoats.



