= [[span class="st"]]**ADDENDUM 9966.9:**[[/span]] **NOTABLE EVENTS TIMELINE**

------

[[div class="notabledate"]]

2034/07/05

[[/div]] [[[SCP-179]]] has reoriented its arms toward Earth. The gesture has remained constant since initial observation, with no indication of reversion to prior behavior. No concurrent solar or extraterrestrial anomalies were detected. Event has been classified as a probable effect of SCP-9966.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2034/07/22

[[/div]] [[[second-hytoth-hub|GoI-088 "Church of The Second Hytoth"]]] enacted an unanticipated exodus, abandoning terrestrial operations and leading a coordinated retreat beyond Earth’s atmosphere. Witnesses describe vast, luminous structures ascending from multiple Foundation red zones. Orbital surveillance confirmed a convoy of anomalous vessels dispersing into deep space before vanishing from all tracking arrays. All members of the [[[wilson-s-wildlife-solutions-hub|GoI-466 "Wilson's Wildlife Solutions"]]] disappeared on the same day. Their website was wiped only leaving the following message:

[[div class="related" style="padding:0px"]]

[[div class="wilson-header"]]

Farewell From WWS!

[[/div]]

[[div class="wilson-body"]]

It was a clear night. The lights went out just for a few seconds. I assumed it was the breaker in the basement and headed down there. The lights were back on before I could reach them. Then I heard a cry from the talkie. Fae said Old Al was having a heart attack. I assumed he got scared because of the lights going out. I rushed out to get there but saw others on the ground outside… More than half of our volunteers were dead. We assumed the worst, one of our critters went unhappy. But it wasn't that. Before I could collect myself to contact the Supervisors, I got a call from a church of some sort. They asked for my help and offered us a ticket in return. They said I should speak nothin' about that call to anybody, so I can't say more. But I learned that the Supervisors who helped us construct WWS into what it is today were total douchebags behind the curtain.



I, Tim Wilson, hereby drop everything to do with the so-called Boring Agreement. This is a unanimous decision from the remaining members of the WWS family. We released the critters. All of them! Even the marine ones are now free in the ocean. This world be their world now. A world of critters, weird or otherwise. Thanks for all the support we got from the community over the years, from the bottom of my heart. We were doing the right thing under the control of the wrong people. I apologize to you for not realizing this sooner.



WWS is leaving town. I cannot say much about how and why, as I promised to the callers. Hope to meet with all of you up there!

-Tim Wilson

[[/div]]

[[/div]]



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2034/09/18

[[/div]] Several island nations experienced full systemic collapse following anomalous pressure from SCP-9966, with entire populations lost to mass exposure events. Within seventy-two hours, Foundation web-crawlers executed global excision protocols, erasing all digital records, satellite imagery, and public documentation of the affected territories. Concurrently, worldwide Class-D amnestic distribution was covertly administered via pharmaceutical supply chains and aerosol dispersal in major transit hubs. Subsequent geopolitical adjustments were framed as long-standing cartographic misconceptions or declassified “Cold War-era territorial disputes”.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2034/11/29

[[/div]] After reports of a significant increase in dolphin beachings in Australia, foundation cryptozoologists were tasked to investigate. Several carcasses are found to be an instance of [[[SCP-3932|SCP-3932-Δ]]]. To date, 27 beached dolphins are confirmed to be SCP-3932-Δ instances, with estimates on the total ranging between 300 and 2000. No additional containment effort was made since deceased instances do not show any anomalous properties. Initially assumed to be the result of an internal conflict, these deaths were later attributed to SCP-9966.

[[include <a href="/component:image-block">component:image-block</a> name=beached-dolphin.jpg|caption= An image taken by the locals before Foundation involvement.|width=600px|align=center]]



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2035/05/05

[[/div]] Members of [[[fifthist-hub|GoI-555 "The United Southern Fifthist Church"]]] started to convert their meeting location in Midland, Texas into a launch structure during the span of a week, naming this process "The Five-Step Skyward Program". A pamphlet containing interviews with famous members of the program started circulating in North America. Most instances of this publication were destroyed, and the remaining ones in circulation were attributed to a cover story about a viral marketing scheme. In the course of a week, all known members gathered, seemingly awaiting the launch mentioned in the pamphlet. [[[SCP-4703|These events could not be interrupted due to their actions being perfectly legal.]]][[span class="fnnum2"]].[[/span]][[span class="fncon2"]]thank you very much[[/span]] On Friday, the building started to collapse inward to reveal mechanisms that folded upon themselves, forming a crude launch tower. On Sunday, a space shuttle emerged from the ground and launched. Foundation satellites tracked the shuttle until it left the atmosphere, where it apparently attained faster-than-light speeds. No further data could be collected. The departure marked the final recorded presence of The United Southern Fifthist Church. No transmissions, sightings, or activity have been intercepted since. The launch was covered up as the testing phase of a passenger space vehicle.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2035/06/02

[[/div]] Following standard containment procedures, [[[SCP-4000]]] failed to produce its anomalous effects and was declared Neutralized after a hypothesized total collapse of its extradimensional topography. Further analysis showed remaining pathways degraded into non-navigable voids, resulting in the disappearance of all landmarks and entities previously catalogued within the anomaly. Subsequent expeditions confirmed SCP-4000 no longer manifests, with residual thaumaturgic signatures decaying to baseline values. Official Foundation statement designates the phenomenon a "natural terminus event", though internal memoranda suggest deliberate cessation triggered by SCP-9966 correlation remains under investigation.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2035/08/15

[[/div]] During a coordinated blackout in New York City, [[[unusual-incidents-unit-hub|GoI-102 "F.B.I. Unusual Incidents Unit"]]] attempted an emergency containment measure by deploying a rapid-response “urban canopy” system: a series of military-grade tarps and modular coverings intended to obscure direct visibility of SCP-9966 from street level. The operation collapsed within minutes as high winds shredded the material, anchoring points failed across multiple boroughs, and several segments ignited after contact with live power lines. The partial coverings created irregular dark zones that only accelerated civilian exposure, resulting in ███ fatalities before Foundation MTF Iota-707 agents re-established full artificial light saturation. The tarp fragments were later attributed in the media to a “classified disaster-response drill.” All surviving civilians were treated with amnestics.

[[include <a href="/component:image-block">component:image-block</a> name=nyc-outage.jpg|caption= An image taken during the re-establishment of containment, with the canopy system visible on the top right.|width=600px|align=center]]



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2035/08/27

[[/div]] The following email and the attached document, seemingly written by The Critic, a prominent figure among of [[[are-we-cool-yet-hub|GoI-267 "Are We Cool Yet?"]]], has been delivered to a Foundation front art gallery run by MTF Epsilon-023 "Art Critics" via e-mail:

[[div class="related"]]

Foundation,



[[[the-cool-war-hub|Murderer Ruiz Duchamp]]] sent this "proposal" to me. I am aware that you are hiding something in the sky. I am also sane enough to not mess with your large scale projects, unlike Duchamp. Not sure what is wrong with the sky, but I know this man will use it to kill people. I will play along with him and get you an exact location. I expect it to be in Belgium, or near.

Please be cool enough to not track this message back to me since I did not take my precautions in order to alert you in time.



Regards,

The Critic

[[div class="blockquote"]]

**Name:** You Know Who I Am

  

**Title:** //It Says "Gullible" on the Ceiling//

[!-- LMAO  --]





**Material Requirements:**  

* A vast atrium (already prepared for the event)

* A huge painting (already placed in the atrium)

* A large audience (already invited to the event)

**Abstract:** Audience members socialize for a while, waiting for a big reveal. They will assume the big reveal is the painting under the cloth. Ohhhhhhhhhh how wrong they'll be.

When the time is right the cloth gets removed. They see the painting of a hand pointing up, and:



BAM! LIGHTS! FUCKING! OUT!



Not just the building, no. Not just the street either. And they'll finally see them. THE FUCKING STARS. They'll learn what was hidden by the foundation FROM ALL OF US!



It will be beautiful, no critics required.



**Intent:** REPLY TO ME YOU DUMBSHIT! come and see THE PERFORMANCE for yourself UNTIL TOMORROW NIGHT!!!!!!!! OR THIS WILL GO DOWN!!



P.S. Die! Rot In Hell! You Suck And Die!1!!!1!

[[/div]]

[[/div]]

Upon review of the document, both Epsilon-023 and Iota-707 were put on high alert in Belgium. After 9 hours, an anonymous call was made to a member of Epsilon-023 by someone claiming to be an assistant of The Critic. Acting upon the information, the MTF located a meeting hall fitting the description made in the document and intercepted it before midnight. A viewing of the private collection of a curator was being held. All attendees were interviewed, but no leads were found on Ruiz Duchamp. Per order of the Overwatch Command, further tracking of The Critic was not carried out.[[span class="fnnum2"]].[[/span]][[span class="fncon2"]]##77DDFF|No need to antagonize //them//.##[[/span]]



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2035/09/09

[[/div]] [[[church-of-the-broken-god-hub|GoI-004-A "The Broken Church"]]] initiated their departure under the guise of a planetary-scale “Final Migration”. Across multiple continents, entire congregations converted themselves and their machineries into modular components before assembling into vast mechanical constructs, some spanning several kilometers in length. These constructs ascended from Earth’s surface under their own propulsion after activating rudimentary optical shielding systems. The ones that could be tracked by Foundation satellites converged into a single lattice in low-earth orbit before accelerating into deep space. This process was not interfered with, and a simple UFO hoax cover story was deemed enough due to the low noticeability of the constructs.



[[include <a href="/component:image-block">component:image-block</a> name=orbit-spacecraft.jpg|caption= The clearest captured image of the lattice taken by a Foundation satellite.|width=600px|align=center]]



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2035/10/18

[[/div]] [[[marshall-carter-and-dark-hub|GoI-012 "Marshall, Carter & Dark"]]] formally withdrew their executive presence from Earth's surface, relocating operations to [[[SCP-1678]]], UnLondon, under the guise of "strategic divestment". Almost immediately, they began marketing spacecraft to private clients, offering "extraterrestrial continuity packages" at prices restricted to heads of state, oligarchs, and known persons of interest. Each vessel was advertised as fully capable of interstellar travel, with luxury accommodations and thaumaturgic shielding against SCP-9966’s influence.[[span class="fnnum2"]].[[/span]][[span class="fncon2"]]As the effect of SCP-9966 is limited to the Earth's cognitosphere, a shielding of this nature would be unnecessary. This either shows a lack of knowledge about the anomaly, or it was an intentional marketing ploy.[[/span]] Intelligence intercepts confirm multiple transactions and at least four verified launches.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2036/02/19

[[/div]] Adherents of [[[church-of-the-broken-god-hub|GoI-004-C "Maxwellism"]]] enacted their retreat by activating a prepared network of distributed servers and anomalous data-cores, uploading their consciousnesses into the cyberspace. Over the course of six hours, entire communities entered voluntary neurological shutdown as their consciousnesses were permanently transferred into the digital construct. Attempts to trace their migration revealed only recursive encryption loops and data-mazes designed to repel intrusion. Physical Maxwellist sites were left abandoned, with only inert hardware and ritual graffiti declaring, “The flesh is obsolete. The Circuit endures. We are one.” Following the incident, an unknown group of cyber-vandals uploaded an image of SCP-9966 into the construct. Following this, Foundation web-crawlers successfully entered the construct and found no traces of sapient activity within it.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2036/04/10

[[/div]] In response to escalating SCP-9966 related activity, [[[serpent-s-hand-hub|GoI-019 "Serpent's Hand"]]] members executed a coordinated withdrawal into the Wanderer's Library. Within hours, every known Hand presence on Earth's surface had vanished. Attempts by Foundation agents to trace or infiltrate the exodus failed, with Ways collapsing immediately after activation. All points of contact with the Wanderer's Library failed completely afterwards.[[span class="fnnum2"]].[[/span]][[span class="fncon2"]]##77DDFF|She took care of those before leaving.##[[/span]]



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2036/04/14

[[/div]] In an attempt to stay in business, [[[anderson-robotics-hub|GoI-115 "Anderson Robotics"]]] rushed production of a line of anomalous prosthetic eyes advertised as “immune” to SCP-9966’s lethality. Early distribution targeted wealthy clients and high-value MC&D partners seeking safe passage under open skies. Within days of deployment, catastrophic failures were reported: the prosthetics either transmitted SCP-9966’s effects with accelerated lethality or catastrophically malfunctioned, causing neural feedback that liquefied ocular and frontal lobe tissue. Entire production lines were abandoned after multiple high-profile fatalities, and Anderson’s remaining infrastructure fragmented under Foundation raids and client reprisals.



[[include <a href="/component:image-block">component:image-block</a> name=anderson-eye.jpg|caption= An instance recovered in one of the raids.|width=600px|align=center]]



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2036/05/22

[[/div]] Multiple sects of the [[[sarkicism-hub|GoI-028 "Neo-Sarkicism"]]] performed synchronized apotheotic rituals, intending to elevate members into combined divine forms capable of withstanding SCP-9966’s influence. The ceremony, conducted on flesh-altars spanning three continents, collapsed catastrophically when biological growth spiraled out of control. Participants were integrated into uncontrolled masses of non-specific tissue. Within hours, every ritual site devolved into an expanding organic sludge, accompanied by seismic disturbances and atmospheric contamination. No survivors were recovered.



Within hours of ritual collapse, MTF Beta-7 "Maz Hatters" was deployed alongside orbital-strike assets to incinerate or vitrify contaminated zones before local authorities could respond. Civilian exposure was suppressed by releasing tailored Class-A aerosol amnestics into surrounding population centers, distributed via “emergency disaster relief” air support.

[[include <a href="/component:image-block">component:image-block</a> name=flesh-titan.jpg|caption= An image captured by a surveillance drone to confirm a hit.|width=600px|align=center]]





Public explanation framed the events as a convergence of industrial accidents, bioterror incidents, and natural disasters: sudden chemical plant explosions, pipeline ruptures, and a series of coordinated “eco-terrorist” attacks. Satellite imagery was censored through A.R.S.H. infrastructure, ensuring only Foundation-approved visuals circulated.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2036/06/03

[[/div]] Intelligence intercepts confirmed a sudden and sustained influx of Marshall, Carter & Dark capital into [[[goc-hub-page|GoI-016 "Global Occult Coalition"]]] operations. The funding, routed through layered anomalous banking networks and UnLondon shell firms, arrived without clear conditions or publicized contracts. GOC leadership has refused to acknowledge the source, though field reports indicate rapid upgrades in thaumaturgic armaments, expanded deployment of orbital assets, and experimental spacecraft assembly.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2036/07/26

[[/div]] [[[SCP-2006]]] has ceased its prior behavior of adopting exaggerated “frightening” forms and now maintains a stable manifestation. The entity currently presents as a humanoid figure composed of a shifting projection of the night sky, with observable stellar patterns and regions of void mapped across its surface. SCP-2006 exhibits no attempt at communication or performance, instead remaining stationary for extended periods. No anomalous emissions have been recorded beyond its visual appearance; however, containment teams note the entity’s behavior constitutes a complete departure from previously established patterns. Research into the correlation between SCP-2006’s transformation and the progression of SCP-9966 is ongoing.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2036/09/26

[[/div]] Foundation intelligence confirmed the establishment of a cooperative framework between the [[[manna-charitable-foundation-hub|GoI-033 "Manna Charitable Foundation"]]], and the Global Occult Coalition. Joint operations have been observed in multiple urban centers, focusing on the distribution of anomalous medical supplies, mass inoculation against cognitohazards, and deployment of improvised protective infrastructure. While MCF assets appear to be acting under humanitarian pretense, intercepted communications suggest direct logistical integration with GOC paramilitary units. The alliance has significantly increased the Coalition’s ability to project force under the guise of relief efforts. Foundation assessment categorizes the partnership as a strategic escalation, with MCD’s recent financial support likely serving as the facilitating factor.



[[div class="notabledate"]]

2037/01/07

[[/div]]United Nations released the following statement through media channels in 87 countries. Overwatch Command deemed this as the start of a Lifted Veil scenario and ordered the reallocation of all veil-preservation activities to the SCP-9966 containment and research.

[[div class="document"]]



[[=image https://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/art:goc-logos/Technology-Tangential.png style="width: 1em]]



[[=]]

++++ UNITED NATIONS OFFICE OF OUTER SPACE AFFAIRS

++ OPERATION: AD ASTRA

[[/=]]



The United Nations, in partnership with the Global Occult Coalition, the Serpent’s Hand, and the Manna Charitable Foundation, announces the adoption of Operation: Ad Astra, a coordinated international initiative to secure the long-term survival of humanity.



In recent years, Earth has faced increasingly severe and unexplained celestial phenomena. These events, collectively referred to as the "Constellation Crisis", have led scientific, humanitarian, and international organizations to conclude that traditional protective measures will not be enough to safeguard every community on Earth. In response, a coalition of nations, experts, and humanitarian partners has prepared a two-part strategy to ensure humanity’s continuity beyond our planet.



+++ Phase One: Launch Sites



Participating nations are converting aerospace facilities, shipyards, and industrial complexes into rapid-assembly launch sites. Modular spacecraft will carry people, seed banks, cultural records, and medical supplies into orbit. This fleet will include:



* **Life Transports:** vessels to carry civilians, families, and essential personnel.



* **Continuity Carriers:** ships dedicated to preserving archives, seeds, and knowledge.



* **Protective Platforms:** orbital stations designed to shield and stabilize transit routes.





By spreading launch operations across many regions, the coalition reduces the risk of disruption and ensures wider access to departure opportunities.



= **[REDACTED FOR BREVITY]**



+++ Phase Two: Paragateway Initiative



In addition to spacecraft launches, the Serpent’s Hand will employ long-standing expertise in the field of “transit gateways”, passages between Earth and other safe locations. These Ways will be opened in selected urban areas around the world, providing direct access to secure off-world staging grounds.



To ensure safety and order:



* Medical and humanitarian staff will be present at every Way to screen and assist travelers.





* Transit schedules will be coordinated internationally, with priority given to families, vulnerable populations, and essential workers.





* Security measures will protect these gateways from interference or misuse.





+++ Ethical Principles and Fair Access



The United Nations affirms that Operation: Ad Astra is guided by three principles:



* **Preservation:** safeguarding human life, knowledge, and cultural diversity.





* **Fairness:** ensuring that places on transports and at Ways are allocated transparently and not solely by wealth or nationality.





* **Compassion:** providing care and dignity to all individuals, including those who may not be able to leave Earth immediately.





To this end, an international ethics council with representatives from all partner organizations and the Manna Charitable Foundation will oversee the selection process and publish regular reports on fairness, safety, and humanitarian standards.



= **[REDACTED FOR BREVITY]**



+++ Looking Forward



Operation: Ad Astra is an unprecedented act of cooperation between governments, humanitarian organizations, and knowledge-keepers from traditions both scientific and cultural. It reflects our shared belief that humanity’s story does not end here, but continues among the stars and across new frontiers.



= **[REDACTED FOR BREVITY]**



+++ Steering Group



* UN Under-Secretary General for Emergency Coordination



* Manna Charitable Foundation Board of Directives



* Liaison of the Serpent’s Hand, Tilda Moose



* General Director of the Global Occult Coalition, D.C. Al Fine



+++ Public Guidance



Citizens are encouraged to remain calm, follow official instructions, and await information on regional launch facilities and designated Way access points. Updates will be provided by national governments in coordination with the United Nations.



Further details on eligibility, transit procedures, and humanitarian support will be published in subsequent bulletins.



For media inquiries, please contact:

= **[REDACTED FOR BREVITY]**

[[/div]]

[[/div]]



