Due to the unplanned departure of 17 high ranking personnel, including Dr. Placeholder McD, Dir. Eli Forkley and Dr. Lillihammer, all Foundation personnel below Level 3 are now allowed to join Operation: Ad Astra. All Foundation sites will be provided with Class-F amnestics which are to be administered to all personnel who wish to relieve themselves of their duties.



Secure. Contain. Protect.

