"When he was promoted to Deputy Director in 2002 (the year after our wedding), they gutted and remodeled his old office. I took this picture right before they did it. Sometimes I look at it and try to remember what happened there in '95 (and about a hundred times after), but it only gets harder and harder.[[footnote]]Maybe if the desk was still there?[[/footnote]] The passage of time is bittersweet, I think."

