[[/div]]



[[div class="grove"]]

[[f<image hargrovespfp.png width="35px"]]**Dr. Hargroves:** I wouldn't have expected anything less. It seems that 9990 is quite good at cloaking things from us.

[[/div]]



[[div class="gibbs"]]

