//The camera is set on a tripod with a clear view of Table Rock on the other side of the gorge. Rune, Hargroves, and Gibbs can be seen sitting side by side from behind, the camera back far enough to catch them in frame without blocking the view. Twenty-five minutes into the recording, balls of light emerge and float along the other side of the gorge. The team watches them like shooting stars.// 



**Dr. Gibbs:** I guess we got lucky.



**Dr. Rune:** They’re beautiful, really. 



//Dr. Hargroves lays back on the grass.// 



**Dr. Hargroves:** Hah! You wouldn’t think so, by the stories people tell about em. I got a whole earful about ghosts, murders, and missing men.



